  <item>
    <title>Ep. 20 被遗忘的50%：社会如何“看不见”女性的存在？🔍👀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67dbdb6678103db3bdbfa00b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67dbdb6678103db3bdbfa00b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Mar 2025 09:29:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Shownotes:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📌 本期摘要：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们一起聊聊《看不见的女性》这本书，探讨现实世界中女性被忽视的数据缺口，以及它如何影响职场、科技、城市规划等多个领域。同时，我们也会回顾 </span><strong><span>中国东北地区的女性平权发展</span></strong><span>，以及 </span><strong><span>#MeToo 运动在中国的演变</span></strong><span>，并对比 </span><strong><span>第三波女权主义在中外的发展</span></strong><span>。希望这期节目能带给大家更多思考，让我们一起关注女性的真实处境！💡✨本期节目片头音乐寓意非常好，希望可以给女性同胞带来力量。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎧 你将听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🔹 </span><strong><span>《看不见的女性》核心观点总结</span></strong><span> —— 女性如何在数据中“隐形”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔹 </span><strong><span>东北女性地位为何较高？</span></strong><span> —— 结合历史与数据，解析社会背景</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔹 </span><strong><span>第三波女权主义的全球对比</span></strong><span> —— 如何突破性别刻板印象？</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔹 </span><strong><span>中国 #MeToo 运动发展</span></strong><span> —— 关键事件与现实挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔹 </span><strong><span>“Trad Wife” 现象探讨</span></strong><span> —— 传统妻子文化背后的争议</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔹</span><strong><span>时代对比</span></strong><span> —— AI编剧如何编写不同时代的女性成长经历</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>📢 互动讨论：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>你对本期话题有什么看法呢？欢迎在评论区留言，或者在社交媒体上和我们互动！📩🎙</span></p><span></span><p><span>📢 </span><strong><span>喜欢我们的节目？</span></strong><span> 欢迎订阅、转发，给我们多多好评哦！🌟💖</span></p><span></span><p><span>开场曲 </span><strong><span>Always by Your Side</span></strong><span> &nbsp;</span><em><span>Song by House Of Say ‧ 2024</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>Always by your side</span></p><span></span><p><span>I'll be always by your side</span></p><span></span><p><span>Through shifting skies and endless miles</span></p><span></span><p><span>I'll walk with you through every trial</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hey, listen up, I gotta say It's super important, we all need a place</span></p><span></span><p><span>Where we can just check in, kick back, unwind</span></p><span></span><p><span>Surrounded by the weirdos that feel like mine</span></p><span></span><p><span>These are your people, cheering you on</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tissues for tears when things go wrong</span></p><span></span><p><span>A friendly shove, yeah, they've got your back</span></p><span></span><p><span>With love like that, there's nothing you lack</span></p><span></span><p><span>It's more than just being there, it's a vibe</span></p><span></span><p><span>Heart-to-heart moments, feeling alive</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>永遠在你身邊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我會一直在你身邊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>穿越變幻的天空和無盡的距離</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我會陪你度過每一個考驗</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘿，聽著，我得說這非常重要，我們都需要一個地方</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我們可以在這裡登記入住、休息、放鬆</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>被那些感覺像我的一樣的怪人包圍著</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>這些都是你的人民，為你加油</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>事情出錯時用紙巾擦眼淚</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>友善的推搡，是的，他們會支持你</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>有了這樣的愛，你什麼都不缺</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>這不僅是身臨其境，更是一種氛圍</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>心與心的交流，感受生命的力量</span></strong></p>]]></description>
